==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{q|obsolete}} {{l|en|systematick}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|systématique}}, from {{der|en|grc|συστηματικός}}, from {{suffix|grc|σύστημᾰ|-ῐκός|nocat=1}}.  {{doublet|en|systemic}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˌsɪs.təˈmæt.ɪk/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-systematic.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|en|ætɪk}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Carried out using a [[planned]], [[ordered]] [[procedure]].
# [[methodical|Methodical]], [[regular]] and [[orderly]].
# Of, or relating to [[taxonomic]] [[classification]].
# {{lb|en|proscribed}} Of, relating to, or being a [[system]]. {{rfex|en}}

